			"date": "2025-04-03T19:07:50.613Z",
			"content": "<p>Oh, did you have attack challenge mode specifically turned on? It would make sense that it is in front of all incoming requests.</p>\n<p>If you still want to challenge traffic *except* `image/`, you can create an exclusion with a custom WAF rule.</p>",
